{"date":"2006-01-01","platform":"其他","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/b6/83/104661_C07fz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/b6/83/104661_C07fz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/b6/83/104661_C07fz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/b6/83/104661_C07fz.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/b6/83/104661_C07fz.jpg"},"summary":"故事的主人公是一只无翼鸟（几维鸟，Kiwi），它有着长长的喙，棕褐色的羽毛衬上一双黑豆般的小眼睛，可怜可爱，其貌不扬。无翼鸟最明显的特点，是没有同类那赖以乘空飞翔的翅膀和尾翼。由此决定它只能痴痴仰望天空，遥不可及的梦想。这一日，无翼鸟艰难地用长喙拉着一个长皮筋，将其费力地绑在树上。随后跳到悬崖下方，用随身携带地锤子费力地在云雾缭绕的岩壁上契入钉子。经过不知多久的忙碌，一切准备就绪。我们的无翼鸟头戴飞行员头套，朝着本不可能的梦想飞奔而去…… \r\n　　本片为美国School of Visual学生毕业作品。","name":"Kiwi!","name_cn":"无翼鸟","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":72,"total_count":102559},{"name":"欧美","count":44,"total_count":86976},{"name":"2006","count":26,"total_count":34333},{"name":"原创","count":22,"total_count":622106},{"name":"美国","count":12,"total_count":27212},{"name":"3D","count":11,"total_count":51212},{"name":"励志","count":11,"total_count":28370},{"name":"催泪","count":9,"total_count":60457},{"name":"毕业设计","count":6,"total_count":17},{"name":"WEB","count":5,"total_count":72196},{"name":"泪目","count":5,"total_count":358},{"name":"Short_film","count":3,"total_count":433},{"name":"动物","count":3,"total_count":6219},{"name":"动画短片","count":3,"total_count":2076},{"name":"Short","count":2,"total_count":1547},{"name":"国外","count":2,"total_count":38},{"name":"还行","count":1,"total_count":1172},{"name":"感人","count":1,"total_count":1549},{"name":"2006年6月","count":1,"total_count":90},{"name":"值得一看","count":1,"total_count":441},{"name":"四分","count":1,"total_count":136},{"name":"其它","count":1,"total_count":917},{"name":"70-80","count":1,"total_count":70},{"name":"赞","count":1,"total_count":315},{"name":"喜爱","count":1,"total_count":157},{"name":"2006年","count":1,"total_count":1888},{"name":"approved","count":1,"total_count":60},{"name":"于是，它奔向了真正能够实现梦想之地","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":3575